runSimpleString -- execute Python source code from a string in __main__
***********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        runSimpleString s
  * Inputs:
      * s, a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, containing Python source
        code;

Description
===========

This function a is wrapper around the function PyRun_SimpleString (see
https://docs.python.org/3/c-api/veryhigh.html#c.PyRun_SimpleString ) from the
Python C API.  Note that, unlike *note pythonValue: pythonValue,, it has no
return value.

+----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : runSimpleString "print('Hello, world!')" |
+----------------------------------------------+

